    "q": "Define cor pulmonale and its PCWP per p4.",
    "a": "Right-heart failure due to a pulmonary cause; the left heart is completely normal and PCWP is normal. Vignette: JVD and peripheral edema with overt lung disease (100-pack-year smoking, cystic fibrosis, pulmonary fibrosis).",
