    "category": "Surg Cardio",
    "q": "Cirrhosis and nephrotic proteinuria as causes of bilateral pitting edema per p5?",
    "a": "Cirrhosis: decreased hepatic albumin production, decreased intravascular oncotic pressure, transudation into the legs. Proteinuria: hypoalbuminemia, decreased oncotic pressure, same transudation.",
